Add Docker deploy setup

The player shells out to yt-dlp and proxies the audio stream, so it needs a
long-running host rather than a static or serverless one.

- Dockerfile: node 20 + python3 + ffmpeg + yt-dlp, runs as non-root, drops
  dev dependencies, takes PORT from the platform
- .dockerignore keeps node_modules, screenshots and logs out of the image
- README: deploy notes and the reason Vercel/Netlify cannot host this
